  <span class="woocommerce-Price-amount amount"><bdi><span class="woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol" translate="no">&#8377;</span>&nbsp;17,990.00</bdi></span> <small class="woocommerce-price-suffix">(Inclusive of all taxes)</small></p>
