<div class="product-short-description">
	<ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none">
<li><span class="a-list-item">Adjustable-tension thumbsticks</span></li>
<li><span class="a-list-item">Shorter hair trigger locks</span></li>
<li><span class="a-list-item">Wrap-around rubberised grip</span></li>
<li><span class="a-list-item">Re-engineered components</span></li>
<li><span class="a-list-item">What’s in the box: Xbox Elite Wireless Controller Series 2, Carrying case, Set of 6 thumbsticks: Standard (2), Classic (2), Tall (1), Wide Dome (1), Set of 4 paddles: Medium (2), Mini (2), Set of 2 D-pads: Standard, Faceted, Thumbstick-adjustment tool, Charging dock &amp; USB-C cable.</span></li>
<li><span class="a-list-item">Enhance your aiming with new adjustable-tension thumbsticks, fire even faster with shorter hair trigger locks, and stay on target with a wrap-around rubberized grip.</span></li>
<li><span class="a-list-item">Tailor the controller to your preferred gaming style with new interchangeable thumbstick and paddle shapes.</span></li>
<li><span class="a-list-item">Save up to 3 custom profiles and 1 default profile on the controller and switch between them on the fly with the Profile button.</span></li>
<li><span class="a-list-item">Utilize exclusive configuration options such as button mapping to voice commands such as “record that” or “take a screenshot”.</span></li>
<li><span class="a-list-item">Assign a button to act as a ‘Shift key’ to enable alternative inputs for each of the other buttons.</span></li>
<li>Microsoft India Warranty</li>
</ul>
</div>
 <p class="stock in-stock">Order it now!<br>Delivery By: <Strong> 05/10/2026 - 13/10/2026 </strong></p>

	
